# ShopValue SaaS Project Development Rules

## **PROJECT CONTEXT & GOALS**

**Mission:** Build a fully automated, revenue-generating price tracking SaaS for Romanian market targeting €2-5K MRR in 6 months with <2 hours/week maintenance.

**Revenue Model:**
- Free: 5 products, daily checks
- Pro: €19.99/month, 50 products, 4x daily checks, price history
- Enterprise: €49.99/month, unlimited products, API access, hourly checks

**Key Success Metrics:**
- 1,000+ users by month 6
- 15% trial-to-paid conversion rate
- 5% monthly churn rate
- >95% email delivery rate
- <200ms API response time
- >95% scraping success rate

---

## **MANDATORY TECH STACK (NO SUBSTITUTIONS)**

### **Frontend & Framework**
- **Next.js 14 (App Router)** - ONLY App Router, no Pages Router
- **TypeScript** - Strict mode enabled, no `any` types
- **Tailwind CSS** - Utility-first styling, no CSS modules or styled-components
- **Shadcn/ui** - Component library, no other UI libraries

### **Authentication**
- **Clerk** - ONLY Clerk for authentication, no custom auth
- Must implement all webhooks: user.created, user.updated, user.deleted, session.created
- Use middleware.ts for route protection

### **Payments**
- **Stripe** - ONLY Stripe for payments, no other processors
- Must implement all webhooks: subscription lifecycle, payment events
- Use Stripe Customer Portal for subscription management
- Must support both monthly and annual billing

### **Database**
- **MongoDB Atlas** - ONLY MongoDB, no PostgreSQL or other databases
- Use Mongoose for ODM
- Must implement all specified indexes from PRD
- TTL indexes for automatic data cleanup

### **Caching**
- **Upstash Redis** - ONLY Upstash, no other Redis services
- Implement caching for all API endpoints
- Cache invalidation on data updates

### **Email**
- **Resend** - ONLY Resend for emails, no SendGrid or others
- Use React Email for templates
- Implement email queue with Bull/BullMQ

### **Monitoring**
- **Sentry** - Error tracking and performance monitoring
- **Amplitude** - User analytics and event tracking
- **Vercel Analytics** - Web vitals and performance

### **Hosting**
- **Vercel** - ONLY Vercel for deployment, no AWS/GCP/Azure
- Configure all cron jobs in vercel.json
- Use Edge functions where appropriate

